00:22:55,240 --> 00:22:57,680
 God's power is greater than our struggles.

274
00:22:57,680 --> 00:23:00,160
 God's plans are higher than our plans.

275
00:23:00,160 --> 00:23:03,520
 God's grace exceeds our imagination.

276
00:23:03,520 --> 00:23:07,440
 (speaking in foreign language)

277
00:23:07,440 --> 00:23:11,320
 Why does Paul speak about God's power here?

278
00:23:12,520 --> 00:23:16,440
 (speaking in foreign language)

279
00:23:16,440 --> 00:23:27,880
 - Why?

280
00:23:27,880 --> 00:23:29,440
 Because everything he has prayed for

281
00:23:29,440 --> 00:23:32,080
 sounds so impossible, right?

282
00:23:32,080 --> 00:23:35,320
 Inner strength, being filled with Christ's love,

283
00:23:35,320 --> 00:23:36,480
 a transformed life.

284
00:23:36,480 --> 00:23:37,520
 What are you talking about?

285
00:23:37,520 --> 00:23:40,080
 I mean, our first reaction is often like,

286
00:23:40,080 --> 00:23:43,400
 maybe Paul, you yourself can do that.

287
00:23:43,400 --> 00:23:45,400
 Well, I cannot.

288
00:23:45,400 --> 00:23:49,320
 (speaking in foreign language)

289
00:24:10,520 --> 00:24:14,440
 (speaking in foreign language)

290
00:24:14,440 --> 00:24:24,720
 - Paul agrees by ourselves, we cannot, but God can.

291
00:24:24,720 --> 00:24:27,400
 Many times we only see our problems,

292
00:24:27,400 --> 00:24:29,360
 limitations and failures.

293
00:24:29,360 --> 00:24:32,480
 We see broken families, struggles in church,

294
00:24:32,480 --> 00:24:36,080
 weakness in ourselves, but Paul reminds us,

295
00:24:36,080 --> 00:24:38,640
 God's power is still at work.

296
00:24:38,640 --> 00:24:42,240
 Perhaps we feel weak, perhaps we feel defeated,

297
00:24:42,240 --> 00:24:44,840
 perhaps we think nothing can be changed,

298
00:24:44,840 --> 00:24:46,280
 but God is able.

299
00:24:46,280 --> 00:24:51,120
 (speaking in foreign language)

300
00:25:08,640 --> 00:25:12,560
 (speaking in foreign language)

301
00:25:12,560 --> 00:25:36,520
 - Where is his power at work?

302
00:25:36,520 --> 00:25:38,280
 Within us.

303
00:25:38,280 --> 00:25:41,120
 God works first in the heart.

304
00:25:41,120 --> 00:25:43,880
 As we said earlier, God often does not begin

305
00:25:43,880 --> 00:25:47,840
 by changing circumstances, he begin by changing people.

306
00:25:47,840 --> 00:25:51,000
 That is why Paul emphasized inner strength

307
00:25:51,000 --> 00:25:53,760
 and being filled with Christ's love.

308
00:25:53,760 --> 00:25:57,840
 Without inner transformation, even improved situation

309
00:25:57,840 --> 00:25:59,800
