310
00:25:59,800 --> 00:26:04,480
 Miracles are not always dramatically external changes.

311
00:26:04,480 --> 00:26:09,160
 Sometimes the greatest miracle is inner transformation,

312
00:26:09,160 --> 00:26:13,320
 from fear to courage, from bitterness to forgiveness,

313
00:26:13,320 --> 00:26:17,160
 from despair to hope, and that is the power of God.

314
00:26:17,160 --> 00:26:22,240
 (speaking in foreign language)

315
00:26:33,520 --> 00:26:37,640
 - Finally, Paul says, to him be glory in the church

316
00:26:37,640 --> 00:26:39,400
 and in the Christ Jesus.

317
00:26:39,400 --> 00:26:42,320
 The ultimate goal is not human success.

318
00:26:42,320 --> 00:26:44,160
 It is not our comfort.

319
00:26:44,160 --> 00:26:46,040
 It is not our satisfaction.

320
00:26:46,040 --> 00:26:49,200
 The ultimate goal is God's glory.

321
00:26:49,200 --> 00:26:53,120
 (speaking in foreign language)

322
00:27:03,560 --> 00:27:07,480
 (speaking in foreign language)

323
00:27:07,480 --> 00:27:23,280
 - When things seem impossible,

324
00:27:23,280 --> 00:27:25,680
 believe that God is still at work.

325
00:27:25,680 --> 00:27:28,880
 We often fall into despair and decide too quickly

326
00:27:28,880 --> 00:27:30,800
