327
00:27:30,800 --> 00:27:33,960
 We say this situation will never improve.

328
00:27:33,960 --> 00:27:38,160
 There is no hope, but man's limit is not God's limit.

329
00:27:38,160 --> 00:27:42,160
 We see obstacles, God sees possibility.

330
00:27:42,160 --> 00:27:44,480
 Have you lost hope in something?

331
00:27:44,480 --> 00:27:47,160
 Paul reminds us, do not limit God

332
00:27:47,160 --> 00:27:50,080
 with your human perspective.

333
00:27:50,080 --> 00:27:54,000
 (speaking in foreign language)

334
00:28:00,840 --> 00:28:04,760
 (speaking in foreign language)

335
00:28:04,760 --> 00:28:10,360
 - God often works quietly, silently,

336
00:28:10,360 --> 00:28:12,520
 like a seed growing on the ground.

337
00:28:12,520 --> 00:28:15,280
 His work may be invisible sometimes.

338
00:28:15,280 --> 00:28:18,720
 We may not see it, but that does not mean

339
00:28:18,720 --> 00:28:20,320
 nothing is happening.

340
00:28:20,320 --> 00:28:24,440
 Even when we cannot feel God, He is still working.

341
00:28:24,440 --> 00:28:27,600
 Even in silence, God is shaping us.

342
00:28:28,800 --> 00:28:32,720
 (speaking in foreign language)

343
00:28:59,800 --> 00:29:04,000
 - Paul's prayer teaches us three important things

344
00:29:04,000 --> 00:29:05,800
 and the truths.

345
00:29:05,800 --> 00:29:09,480
 One, strength begins with prayer.

346
00:29:09,480 --> 00:29:13,760
 Number two, growth comes from knowing

347
00:29:13,760 --> 00:29:16,760
 and experiencing Christ's love.

348
00:29:16,760 --> 00:29:21,760
 Number three, true transformation happens from inside out.

349
00:29:21,760 --> 00:29:24,440
 This transformation does not come

350
00:29:24,440 --> 00:29:27,080
 through human efforts alone.

351
00:29:27,080 --> 00:29:30,320
 It comes through God's working in us.

352
00:29:30,320 --> 00:29:31,880
 The greatest problem for Christian

353
00:29:31,880 --> 00:29:34,120
 is not that we are not busy enough

354
00:29:34,120 --> 00:29:37,040
 or there's not heart working enough.

355
00:29:37,040 --> 00:29:39,040
 The real question is this,

356
00:29:39,040 --> 00:29:41,880
 are we filled with the love of Christ?

357
00:29:41,880 --> 00:29:45,200
 (speaking in foreign language)

358
00:29:45,200 --> 00:29:46,040
 - Let's pray.

359
00:29:46,040 --> 00:29:52,280
 (speaking in foreign language)

360
00:29:58,080 --> 00:30:02,000
 (speaking in foreign language)

361
00:30:02,000 --> 00:30:20,640
 - Heavenly Father, help us recognize our need

362
00:30:20,640 --> 00:30:22,040
