367
00:30:34,440 --> 00:30:38,280
 Teach us to humble ourselves before you

368
00:30:38,280 --> 00:30:40,600
 and begin with prayer.

369
00:30:40,600 --> 00:30:42,800
 Strengthen us through prayer.

370
00:30:42,800 --> 00:30:45,000
 In Jesus' name, amen.

371
00:30:45,000 --> 00:30:45,840
 - Amen.

